- (⭐ GREEN, pipeline 2738001325 on MR !4 — the migration's CI half is PROVEN, with one
  named gap) All five jobs succeeded. What the run actually exercised, in order:
  WIF token exchange ("GCP credentials configured via Workload Identity Federation
  (keyless)") · `dbt deps` · `sqlfluff lint models` -> "All Finished!" (the exact command
  the profile defect killed) · `dbt seed --target ci` -> PASS=6, the first BigQuery WRITE
  this pipeline has ever made from GitLab · the prod-target state compile · `dbt test
  --select test_type:singular` -> **PASS=28 WARN=0 ERROR=0 SKIP=0**, the full singular DQ
